(148, 1, '2011-2012', 28, 'Strengthen Governance Documentation and Stakeholder Access', 'Ensuring transparent governance (indicator 4.2) will improve accountability.\n- Governance Committee Chair to upload School Governance Council minutes to the school website within three days of each meeting (indicator 4.2).\n- Strategic Planning Officer to prepare an annual governance report summarizing SGC decisions and outcomes, released by 30 April.\n- Finance Officer to create a public dashboard of key governance metrics and update it monthly for parent access.', 'Last cycle: “Boost governance transparency and stakeholder engagement”; Result: score declined by 4.2 from 87.5% to 83.3%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 83.30, 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 0, 0, NULL, 37, '2026-10-17 01:15:08', 0),
