(246, 1, '2021-2022', 28, 'D4 Governance and Accountability', '- PTA Chair to formalize PTA operations (indicator 4.3) and hold a membership meeting within 30 days.\n- School Development Team to collaborate with stakeholders and other schools on partnership projects (indicator 4.4) and identify at least one joint initiative by the end of the first quarter.\n- Principal to translate the strategic plan into an implementation plan (indicator 4.1) and present it to the board within 30 days.', 'Last cycle: “Strengthen stakeholder collaboration and policy review”; Result: score improved by 8.4 from 83.3% to 91.7%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 91.70, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 261, 37, '2026-10-18 12:14:51', 0),
(247, 1, '2022-2023', 28, 'D4 Governance and Accountability', '- School Principal, in collaboration with the School Development Team, will schedule quarterly stakeholder forums to review partnership effectiveness, citing indicator 4.4, and ensure action items are documented within 30 days of each meeting.\n- The School Management Team will conduct monthly surveys of internal and external stakeholders to gauge satisfaction, referencing indicator 4.6, and compile a summary report by the end of each month.\n- The Implementation Committee will map the strategic plan to specific operational objectives and monitor progress every month, referencing indicator 4.1, and adjust resource allocation within 30 days of identified gaps.', 'Last cycle: “D4 Governance and Accountability”; Result: score was unchanged from 91.7% to 91.7%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 91.70, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 267, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
(248, 1, '2022-2023', 27, 'D3 Leadership', '- The School Principal will convene a bi-monthly school-community planning team meeting, referencing indicator 3.2, and circulate minutes within 7 days of each session.\n- The Student Government Chair will organize quarterly leadership workshops for student leaders, citing indicator 3.3, and submit a feedback report to the Principal within 30 days.\n- The Curriculum Coordinator will lead a quarterly review of the strategic plan, referencing indicator 3.1, and present actionable recommendations to the Board within 30 days of each review.', 'Last cycle: “D3 Leadership”; Result: score improved by 0.6 from 88.8% to 89.4%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 89.40, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 266, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
(249, 1, '2022-2023', 30, 'D6 Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization', '- The Finance Officer will audit the computer laboratory’s equipment usage monthly, citing indicator 6.5, and produce a maintenance schedule within 30 days.\n- The Facilities Manager will inspect water, electric, and internet facilities every month, referencing indicator 6.4, and report any deficiencies to the Principal within 30 days.\n- The School Administration will conduct a bi-monthly infrastructure inspection, citing indicator 6.1, and update the maintenance log within 30 days of each inspection.', 'Last cycle: “D6 Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization”; Result: score improved by 0.7 from 96.8% to 97.5%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 97.50, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 269, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
(250, 1, '2022-2023', 29, 'D5 Human Resource and Team Development', '- The HR Coordinator will design a needs-based Learning Action Cell program, referencing indicator 5.3, and launch it within the next quarter.\n- The Principal will implement a workload distribution review every month, citing indicator 5.7, and adjust assignments within 30 days of each review.\n- The Office Manager will conduct an office performance commitment survey quarterly, referencing indicator 5.2, and provide a summary to the Principal within 30 days.', 'Last cycle: “D5 Human Resource and Team Development”; Result: score improved by 2.5 from 84.3% to 86.8%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 86.80, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 268, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
(251, 1, '2022-2023', 25, 'D1 Curriculum and Teaching', '- The Curriculum Lead will integrate peace and DepEd core values into lesson plans, citing indicator 1.6, and submit a sample plan every month.\n- The TLE Coordinator will partner with local industries to enhance TLE-TV L courses, referencing indicator 1.8, and arrange at least one industry visit per quarter.\n- The Assessment Officer will monitor Grade 6,10,12 NAT proficiency targets, citing indicator 1.2, and report progress monthly to the Principal.', 'Last cycle: “D1 Curriculum and Teaching”; Result: score improved by 3.5 from 83.1% to 86.6%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 86.60, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 264, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
(252, 1, '2022-2023', 26, 'D2 Learning Environment', '- The ALS Coordinator will ensure the school-based ALS program is fully operational, referencing indicator 2.6, and conduct a monthly readiness check within 30 days.\n- The Principal will enforce a zero child abuse policy by conducting monthly safety briefings, citing indicator 2.2, and document compliance within 30 days.\n- The Attendance Officer will track dropout incidence monthly, referencing indicator 2.3, and submit a corrective action plan within 30 days if rates exceed target.', 'Last cycle: “D2 Learning Environment”; Result: score improved by 3.5 from 91.3% to 94.8%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 94.80, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, 265, 37, '2026-10-18 12:47:51', 0),
