(254, 1, '2023-2024', 26, 'D2 Learning Environment', '- School Principal to implement a zero-tolerance policy against child abuse, reinforcing indicator 2.2, by conducting staff training sessions every month.\n- Principal and Guidance Counselor to develop a dropout prevention plan addressing indicator 2.3, and monitor its implementation quarterly, reporting progress to the school board.\n- Special Education Coordinator to ensure all PWD-friendly facilities (indicator 2.10) are accessible, conducting monthly inspections and updating the facility log.', 'Last cycle: “D2 Learning Environment”; Result: score improved by 2.0 from 94.8% to 96.8%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 96.80, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, NULL, 37, '2026-10-18 13:49:29', 0),
