(256, 1, '2023-2024', 29, 'D5 Human Resource and Team Development', '- HR Coordinator to conduct an office performance review (indicator 5.2) for all staff, completing the first cycle within 30 days and scheduling follow-up sessions quarterly.\n- HR Coordinator to organize professional development workshops (indicator 5.4) every month, tracking attendance and learning outcomes.\n- HR Coordinator to facilitate Learning Action Cells (indicator 5.3) bi-monthly, ensuring needs-based activities are documented and evaluated.', 'Last cycle: “D5 Human Resource and Team Development”; Result: score improved by 2.8 from 86.8% to 89.6%, and an improvement plan was created.', 'Low', 'high', 'sufficient', 89.60, 'openai/gpt-oss-20b', 1, 0, NULL, 37, '2026-10-18 13:49:29', 0),
