(523, 206, 5, 'llm', NULL, 'D6 Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization', '96.8% · +2.5 pts vs last year\nWeakest indicators: 6.4 (avg 3.5), 6.5 (avg 3.7), 6.1 (avg 4.0)\n- Finance Officer to audit water, electric, and internet facilities (indicator 6.4) and report findings within 30 days.\n- IT Coordinator to set up a functional computer laboratory (indicator 6.5) and schedule a training session for teachers within 30 days.\n- Facilities Manager to conduct a quarterly inspection of infrastructure and facilities (indicator 6.1) and compile a maintenance plan within 30 days.', '[\"6.1\",\"6.4\",\"6.5\"]', 87.60, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-18 12:14:51'),
