(253, 1, 25, 25, 174, 'Low', 'With the recent rise to 90.3%, it\'s important to keep momentum while guarding against potential decline.\r\n- Curriculum Coordinator to lead quarterly data‑analysis meetings on student performance, documenting adjustments by the 15th of the month (indicator 1.8).\r\n- Grade Level Leaders to design and implement at least one interdisciplinary community‑based project per term, submitting brief reports within two weeks after term end.\r\n- School Head to approve an annual curriculum audit aligned with DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024, to be completed by 30 June and shared with teachers.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:22', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 04:04:59', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:12', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:22', '2026-10-17 20:04:04', '2026-10-17 20:05:22', NULL, NULL, 0),
(254, 1, 25, 26, 179, 'Low', 'Score rose modestly, but the high decline risk suggests reinforcing support structures.\r\n- Learning Experience Coordinator to schedule monthly outreach classes for out‑of‑school learners, targeting 20 participants per session and logging attendance (indicator 2.5).\r\n- Teachers to upload blended‑learning modules to the school portal weekly and record student progress in the LMS.\r\n- School Head to allocate a quarterly budget for learning materials and transport subsidies, approving allocations by 15 October per DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:24', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 04:04:59', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:14', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:24', '2026-10-17 20:04:13', '2026-10-17 20:05:24', NULL, NULL, 0),
(255, 1, 25, 28, 194, 'Low', 'The drop to 83.3% signals a need for tighter governance mechanisms.\r\n- Governance Committee Chair to conduct semi‑annual stakeholder satisfaction surveys (indicator 4.6) and publish a summary report on the school portal within 15 days of each survey.\r\n- PTA President to host a quarterly partnership showcase, inviting NGOs and neighboring schools, and develop a written memorandum of understanding for each partnership within two weeks.\r\n- School Head to form a Stakeholder Advisory Council that meets bi‑annually, with minutes circulated within five days and actionable recommendations submitted to the school board by 30 April and 30 October.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:26', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 04:04:59', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:16', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:26', '2026-10-17 20:04:31', '2026-10-17 20:05:26', NULL, NULL, 0),
(256, 1, 25, 29, 200, 'Low', 'The decrease to 86.4% suggests a need for enhanced professional growth mechanisms.\r\n- HR Officer to continue the monthly payroll verification checklist (indicator 5.6), confirming processing by the 5th of each month.\r\n- HR Officer to create a quarterly mentorship program pairing experienced teachers with newer staff, with mentorship plans submitted by the 15th of the first month of each quarter.\r\n- School Head to launch a quarterly “Teacher Innovation Grant” program, with application deadlines on the 10th of the month preceding the award announcement on the 20th.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:27', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 04:04:59', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:18', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:27', '2026-10-17 20:04:46', '2026-10-17 20:05:27', NULL, NULL, 0),
(257, 1, 25, 30, 205, 'Low', 'The modest gain to 94.3% is encouraging, yet the high decline risk calls for sustaining transparency.\r\n- Finance Officer to update a monthly cash‑flow dashboard accessible to the school council by the 5th of each month (indicator 6.4).\r\n- Procurement Officer to publish a transparent bidding log on the school portal within three days after each procurement cycle, reviewed quarterly.\r\n- School Head to organize an annual financial literacy workshop for teachers and staff each June, distributing pre‑workshop materials two weeks in advance.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:29', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 04:04:59', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:19', 46, '2026-10-18 04:05:29', '2026-10-17 20:04:55', '2026-10-17 20:05:29', NULL, NULL, 0),
(258, 1, 26, 25, 169, 'Low', '- Principal to convene a quarterly curriculum review meeting focusing on integrating peace and DepEd core values (indicator 1.6) and set a timeline for teacher training within 30 days.\r\n- Lead teacher to develop a lesson plan template that incorporates ALS certification objectives (indicator 1.3) and circulate it to all teachers by the end of the first quarter.\r\n- School Development Team to partner with local industry representatives to enhance TLE-TV L course offerings (indicator 1.8) and schedule a pilot workshop within 30 days.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:15:47', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(259, 1, 26, 26, 177, 'Low', '- School Principal to establish a functional school-based ALS program (indicator 2.6) and appoint a coordinator by the end of the first quarter.\r\n- Child Protection Officer to form a child-protection committee (indicator 2.7) and hold its inaugural meeting within 30 days.\r\n- Teacher in charge of student services to monitor drop‑out incidence (indicator 2.3) and report monthly progress to the school board.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:16:09', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(260, 1, 26, 27, 185, 'Low', '- Principal to set up a school-community planning team (indicator 3.2) and hold its first planning session within 30 days.\r\n- Student Government Chair to coordinate a leadership workshop for Supreme Student Government (indicator 3.3) and schedule it by the end of the first quarter.\r\n- Strategic Planning Officer to draft a strategic plan (indicator 3.1) and circulate it to staff for feedback within 30 days.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:16:18', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(261, 1, 26, 28, 189, 'Low', '- PTA Chair to formalize PTA operations (indicator 4.3) and hold a membership meeting within 30 days.\r\n- School Development Team to collaborate with stakeholders and other schools on partnership projects (indicator 4.4) and identify at least one joint initiative by the end of the first quarter.\r\n- Principal to translate the strategic plan into an implementation plan (indicator 4.1) and present it to the board within 30 days.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:16:27', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(262, 1, 26, 29, 196, 'Low', '- HR Officer to assess office performance commitment and review processes (indicator 5.2) and draft improvement recommendations within 30 days.\r\n- Teacher Development Coordinator to design needs-based Learning Action Cells (indicator 5.3) and launch the first cell by the end of the first quarter.\r\n- Classroom Manager to review teacher workload distribution (indicator 5.7) and adjust assignments quarterly.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:16:48', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(263, 1, 26, 30, 202, 'Low', '- Finance Officer to audit water, electric, and internet facilities (indicator 6.4) and report findings within 30 days.\r\n- IT Coordinator to set up a functional computer laboratory (indicator 6.5) and schedule a training session for teachers within 30 days.\r\n- Facilities Manager to conduct a quarterly inspection of infrastructure and facilities (indicator 6.1) and compile a maintenance plan within 30 days.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:17:02', 46, '2026-10-18 12:29:57', 46, '2026-10-18 12:34:02', '2026-10-18 04:16:57', '2026-10-18 04:34:02', NULL, NULL, 0),
(264, 1, 27, 25, 168, 'Low', '- The Curriculum Lead will integrate peace and DepEd core values into lesson plans, citing indicator 1.6, and submit a sample plan every month.\r\n- The TLE Coordinator will partner with local industries to enhance TLE-TV L courses, referencing indicator 1.8, and arrange at least one industry visit per quarter.\r\n- The Assessment Officer will monitor Grade 6,10,12 NAT proficiency targets, citing indicator 1.2, and report progress monthly to the Principal.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:48:50', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0),
(265, 1, 27, 26, 176, 'Low', '- The ALS Coordinator will ensure the school-based ALS program is fully operational, referencing indicator 2.6, and conduct a monthly readiness check within 30 days.\r\n- The Principal will enforce a zero child abuse policy by conducting monthly safety briefings, citing indicator 2.2, and document compliance within 30 days.\r\n- The Attendance Officer will track dropout incidence monthly, referencing indicator 2.3, and submit a corrective action plan within 30 days if rates exceed target.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:49:01', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0),
(266, 1, 27, 27, 185, 'Low', '- The School Principal will convene a bi-monthly school-community planning team meeting, referencing indicator 3.2, and circulate minutes within 7 days of each session.\r\n- The Student Government Chair will organize quarterly leadership workshops for student leaders, citing indicator 3.3, and submit a feedback report to the Principal within 30 days.\r\n- The Curriculum Coordinator will lead a quarterly review of the strategic plan, referencing indicator 3.1, and present actionable recommendations to the Board within 30 days of each review.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:50:00', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `improvement_plans` (`plan_id`, `school_id`, `cycle_id`, `dimension_id`, `indicator_id`, `priority_level`, `objective`, `strategy`, `person_responsible`, `target_date`, `resources_needed`, `expected_output`, `status`, `workflow_status`, `current_owner_role`, `current_owner_user_id`, `last_action_by`, `last_action_at`, `remarks`, `created_by`, `submitted_by`, `submitted_at`, `approved_by`, `approved_at`, `validated_by`, `validated_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `suggestion_item_id`, `suggestion_baseline_text`, `is_sample`) VALUES
(267, 1, 27, 28, 189, 'Low', '- School Principal, in collaboration with the School Development Team, will schedule quarterly stakeholder forums to review partnership effectiveness, citing indicator 4.4, and ensure action items are documented within 30 days of each meeting.\r\n- The School Management Team will conduct monthly surveys of internal and external stakeholders to gauge satisfaction, referencing indicator 4.6, and compile a summary report by the end of each month.\r\n- The Implementation Committee will map the strategic plan to specific operational objectives and monitor progress every month, referencing indicator 4.1, and adjust resource allocation within 30 days of identified gaps.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:50:15', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0),
(268, 1, 27, 29, 196, 'Low', '- The HR Coordinator will design a needs-based Learning Action Cell program, referencing indicator 5.3, and launch it within the next quarter.\r\n- The Principal will implement a workload distribution review every month, citing indicator 5.7, and adjust assignments within 30 days of each review.\r\n- The Office Manager will conduct an office performance commitment survey quarterly, referencing indicator 5.2, and provide a summary to the Principal within 30 days.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:50:34', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0),
(269, 1, 27, 30, 202, 'Low', '- The Finance Officer will audit the computer laboratory’s equipment usage monthly, citing indicator 6.5, and produce a maintenance schedule within 30 days.\r\n- The Facilities Manager will inspect water, electric, and internet facilities every month, referencing indicator 6.4, and report any deficiencies to the Principal within 30 days.\r\n- The School Administration will conduct a bi-monthly infrastructure inspection, citing indicator 6.1, and update the maintenance log within 30 days of each inspection.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 12:51:49', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 12:52:12', '2026-10-18 04:50:42', '2026-10-18 04:52:12', NULL, NULL, 0),
(270, 1, 28, 28, 189, 'Low', '- Principal to convene the PTA (indicator 4.3) for a monthly meeting, ensuring transparent communication of school plans and budgets.\r\n- Principal to develop an implementation plan for the strategic plan (indicator 4.1) and conduct a quarterly review with the SGC.\r\n- Principal to hold monthly SGC meetings (indicator 4.2) to discuss governance issues and track action items.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 13:52:11', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 13:51:55', 46, '2026-10-18 13:52:08', 46, '2026-10-18 13:52:11', '2026-10-18 05:51:45', '2026-10-18 05:52:11', NULL, NULL, 0),
(271, 1, 29, 28, 190, 'Low', '- School Head to convene a monthly meeting with the School Governance Council (SGC) to review policy implementation (4.2) and set action items, ensuring all council members submit a brief progress report within 30 days of each meeting.\r\n- Parent-Teacher Association (PTA) Chair to organize a quarterly workshop on partnership strategies (4.3), inviting parents and community leaders, and circulate a summary of agreed actions within 30 days after the workshop.\r\n- School Head to establish a bi‑monthly stakeholder collaboration forum (4.4) with local NGOs and government units, documenting partnership outcomes and sharing a brief report with the school board every month.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:13', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 14:12:52', 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:10', 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:13', '2026-10-18 06:09:38', '2026-10-18 06:13:13', NULL, NULL, 0),
(272, 1, 29, 27, 185, 'Low', '- School Head to facilitate a monthly strategic planning session (3.1) with the leadership team, setting measurable goals and assigning owners, and circulate a concise action plan within 30 days.\r\n- Leadership Team Lead to convene a bi‑weekly school‑community planning meeting (3.2) to gather community input, document action items, and share a summary with stakeholders every month.\r\n- Student Government Chair to organize a quarterly student leadership workshop (3.3) focusing on governance skills, and submit a brief reflection report to the Head within 30 days after each workshop.', 'Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'planned', 'finalized', NULL, NULL, 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:13', NULL, 37, 37, '2026-10-18 14:12:52', 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:10', 46, '2026-10-18 14:13:13', '2026-10-18 06:10:52', '2026-10-18 06:13:13', NULL, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `improvement_plan_history` (`history_id`, `plan_id`, `version_no`, `action`, `from_status`, `to_status`, `actor_id`, `remarks`, `snapshot_json`, `created_at`) VALUES
(4, 164, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":164,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":172,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By the end of the school year, teachers will integrate peace and DepEd core values into 100 % of weekly lesson plans across all grade levels, with monthly reviews confirming consistent implementation.\",\"strategy\":\"The lead teachers will embed peace and DepEd core values into each weekly lesson plan, aligning activities with the curriculum framework, and the curriculum team will conduct monthly reviews of these plans to ensure fidelity and provide feedback; necessary contextualized materials will be prepared by the curriculum coordinators by 30 June to support teachers in delivering value‑based content across all grade levels.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. France De Guzman\",\"target_date\":\"2002-06-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:29:19\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:29:19\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:29:19\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:29:19'),
(5, 165, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":165,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":170,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By 30 June 2002, curriculum coordinators and teachers will develop and implement contextualized learning materials for all grade levels that respond to learners’ needs and embed peace and DepEd core values. This will achieve at least a 15 % increase in student engagement scores as measured by quarterly surveys.\",\"strategy\":\"The Curriculum Coordinators will design and produce grade‑level contextualized learning materials that reflect learners’ local realities and DepEd core values, completing the drafts by 30 June; teachers will adapt these resources into weekly lesson plans, integrating peace and core values, and submit them for monthly review to ensure relevance and responsiveness to student needs.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. Jedie\",\"target_date\":\"2002-06-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:30:17\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:30:17\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:30:17\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:30:17'),
(6, 166, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":166,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":169,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By March 2003, the school will ensure that 100 % of its school‑based ALS learners attain elementary and junior high school certification, through quarterly assessment checkpoints and timely reporting overseen by the ALS Coordinator.\",\"strategy\":\"The ALS Coordinator will set quarterly assessment checkpoints that use the contextualized learning materials prepared by the Curriculum Coordinators and embed peace and DepEd core values into each checkpoint’s lesson plans, with teachers reviewing relevance monthly; after each quarter the coordinator will compile and submit a certification progress report to confirm that ALS learners are on track to attain elementary and junior high school completion.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. Jedie\",\"target_date\":\"2003-03-20\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:31:04\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:31:04\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:31:04\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:31:04'),
(7, 167, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":167,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":26,\"indicator_id\":175,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By the end of the academic year, the school will achieve zero bullying incidents, as verified by monthly monitoring reports from the Guidance Counselor’s zero‑bullying awareness program.\",\"strategy\":\"The Guidance Counselors will launch a zero‑bullying awareness program with monthly monitoring of incidents and prompt follow‑up actions, and the Student Welfare Committee will reinforce a respectful climate by organizing culture‑sensitive activities each term; both teams will hold regular coordination meetings to review data, adjust interventions, and ensure the school achieves zero bullying incidence.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Mr. Principal\",\"target_date\":\"2002-04-20\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:32:09\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:32:09\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:32:09\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:32:09'),
(8, 168, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":168,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":26,\"indicator_id\":184,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By December 31, 2003, the school will upgrade all classrooms, restrooms, and common areas to fully meet special‑education and PWD‑friendly standards, and will monitor compliance through monthly zero‑bullying checks and termly culture‑sensitive activities to ensure an inclusive learning environment.\",\"strategy\":\"The Facilities Officer will lead the upgrade of special‑education and PWD‑friendly facilities, ensuring all modifications are completed by 31 December, while Guidance Counselors launch a zero‑bullying awareness program with monthly monitoring and the Student Welfare Committee conducts culture‑sensitive activities each term to foster an inclusive, safe learning environment.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Mr. Head Officer\",\"target_date\":\"2003-12-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:33:34\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:33:34\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:33:34\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:33:34'),
(9, 169, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":169,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":26,\"indicator_id\":178,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"The school will achieve a 90% student and staff satisfaction rating by year‑end through monthly zero‑bullying awareness sessions, completion of all special‑education and PWD‑friendly facility upgrades by 31 December, and the delivery of at least one culture‑sensitive activity each term.\",\"strategy\":\"The Student Welfare Committee will lead the planning and execution of culture‑sensitive activities each term, collaborating with the Guidance Counselor’s zero‑bullying program and the Facilities Officer to secure inclusive, PWD‑friendly venues, and will submit monthly participation reports to monitor progress toward indicator 2.4; all activities will be scheduled in coordination with the school calendar and evaluated against the termly monitoring data to ensure cultural relevance and safety.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Head Teacher\",\"target_date\":\"2002-04-20\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:38:07\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:38:07\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:38:07\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:38:07'),
(10, 170, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":170,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":27,\"indicator_id\":186,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By the end of the academic year, the school will maintain a functional school‑community planning team that meets monthly, develops and implements at least three community‑focused action plans, and submits bi‑monthly progress reports to the School Head. This will ensure consistent strategic planning and execution as required by indicator 3.2.\",\"strategy\":\"The School Head will convene the school‑community planning team monthly to set and prioritize action items, while the Vice Principal mentors department heads on strategic‑plan execution and provides bi‑monthly progress reports to the team; teachers will submit quarterly leadership reflections that are reviewed to inform decision‑making and sustain a functional planning process.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Vice Principal\",\"target_date\":\"2002-05-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:39:09\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:39:09\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:39:09\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:39:09'),
(11, 171, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":171,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":29,\"indicator_id\":200,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"The school will guarantee that all salaries, allowances, and additional compensation are processed accurately and disbursed within five business days of submission, with monthly audits to monitor compliance.\",\"strategy\":\"The HR Officer will verify and process all salary, allowance, and additional compensation submissions within five business days, supported by a monthly audit to ensure accuracy and timeliness, while the Professional Development Coordinator will deliver quarterly training on DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024 to keep staff informed of compensation policies, and the School Head will conduct semi‑annual performance reviews and share feedback to reinforce compliance and promptly address any discrepancies.\",\"person_responsible\":\"HR Office\",\"target_date\":\"2002-09-20\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:40:55\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:40:55\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:40:55\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:40:55'),
(12, 164, 2, 'school_head_submitted', 'draft', 'submitted', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":164,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":172,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By the end of the school year, teachers will integrate peace and DepEd core values into 100 % of weekly lesson plans across all grade levels, with monthly reviews confirming consistent implementation.\",\"strategy\":\"The lead teachers will embed peace and DepEd core values into each weekly lesson plan, aligning activities with the curriculum framework, and the curriculum team will conduct monthly reviews of these plans to ensure fidelity and provide feedback; necessary contextualized materials will be prepared by the curriculum coordinators by 30 June to support teachers in delivering value‑based content across all grade levels.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. France De Guzman\",\"target_date\":\"2002-06-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"submitted\",\"current_owner_role\":\"sbm_coordinator\",\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:29:19\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:42:39'),
(13, 165, 2, 'school_head_submitted', 'draft', 'submitted', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":165,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":170,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By 30 June 2002, curriculum coordinators and teachers will develop and implement contextualized learning materials for all grade levels that respond to learners’ needs and embed peace and DepEd core values. This will achieve at least a 15 % increase in student engagement scores as measured by quarterly surveys.\",\"strategy\":\"The Curriculum Coordinators will design and produce grade‑level contextualized learning materials that reflect learners’ local realities and DepEd core values, completing the drafts by 30 June; teachers will adapt these resources into weekly lesson plans, integrating peace and core values, and submit them for monthly review to ensure relevance and responsiveness to student needs.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. Jedie\",\"target_date\":\"2002-06-30\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"submitted\",\"current_owner_role\":\"sbm_coordinator\",\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:30:17\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:42:39'),
(14, 166, 2, 'school_head_submitted', 'draft', 'submitted', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":166,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":6,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":169,\"priority_level\":\"Medium\",\"objective\":\"By March 2003, the school will ensure that 100 % of its school‑based ALS learners attain elementary and junior high school certification, through quarterly assessment checkpoints and timely reporting overseen by the ALS Coordinator.\",\"strategy\":\"The ALS Coordinator will set quarterly assessment checkpoints that use the contextualized learning materials prepared by the Curriculum Coordinators and embed peace and DepEd core values into each checkpoint’s lesson plans, with teachers reviewing relevance monthly; after each quarter the coordinator will compile and submit a certification progress report to confirm that ALS learners are on track to attain elementary and junior high school completion.\",\"person_responsible\":\"Ms. Jedie\",\"target_date\":\"2003-03-20\",\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"submitted\",\"current_owner_role\":\"sbm_coordinator\",\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:31:04\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 12:42:39\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 04:42:39'),
