(155, 200, 4, 'coordinator_validated', 'approved', 'finalized', 46, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":200,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":12,\"dimension_id\":29,\"indicator_id\":196,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"**Human Resource and Team Development**\\r\\nThe advanced score reduces immediate risk, yet maintaining momentum is important. Continue with:\\r\\n- HR Officer to update individualized Professional Growth Plans for all staff annually, with a mid‑year review by 15 June (indicator 5.2).\\r\\n- Department Heads to keep a monthly peer‑recognition board highlighting exemplary practices, with entries submitted within five days.\\r\\n- Principal to sustain the mentorship program pairing experienced teachers with newcomers, meeting monthly and reporting progress to the HR office (indicator 5.5).\\r\\n- Senior Teachers to lead quarterly Professional Learning Community sessions on instructional strategies, with attendance recorded and summary shared within one week.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"finalized\",\"current_owner_role\":null,\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":46,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:54\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:52:55\",\"approved_by\":46,\"approved_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:42\",\"validated_by\":46,\"validated_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:54\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:51:25\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:54\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 11:53:54'),
(156, 201, 4, 'coordinator_validated', 'approved', 'finalized', 46, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":201,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":12,\"dimension_id\":30,\"indicator_id\":202,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"**Finance and Resource Management and Mobilization**\\r\\nWith an advanced rating, focus on fine‑tuning controls to guard against future dips. Implement:\\r\\n- Finance Officer to keep the electronic expense approval system, ensuring 100% of MOOE requests are logged and approved within three business days (indicator 6.6).\\r\\n- Facilities Manager to continue monthly facility condition surveys and add a quarterly preventive maintenance schedule, submitting a summary report by the 10th of each month (indicator 6.1).\\r\\n- Principal to lead the Cost‑Saving Task Force meetings bi‑monthly, requiring each unit to submit at least one cost‑saving proposal per cycle and report recommendations within five days.\\r\\n- Procurement Officer to conduct a semi‑annual vendor performance review and publish findings to promote transparency.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"finalized\",\"current_owner_role\":null,\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":46,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:56\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:52:55\",\"approved_by\":46,\"approved_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:45\",\"validated_by\":46,\"validated_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:56\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:51:39\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 19:53:56\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 11:53:56'),
(157, 202, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":202,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":13,\"dimension_id\":26,\"indicator_id\":181,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"To sustain the modest improvement, strengthen safety monitoring and support for vulnerable learners.\\r\\n- Child‑Protection Committee Chair to launch a monthly digital dashboard for bullying incidents, updated within two days of each review (indicator 2.7).\\r\\n- Facilities Officer to perform bi‑monthly classroom ergonomics checks and submit an action log to the School Head within three days.\\r\\n- Guidance Counselor to start a peer‑support program for disadvantaged learners, meeting twice a month and tracking participation in a shared register.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:15:50\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:15:50\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:15:50\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 12:15:50'),
(158, 203, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":203,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":13,\"dimension_id\":27,\"indicator_id\":188,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"Given the recent dip, focus on generating and piloting new service ideas for stakeholders.\\r\\n- School‑Community Planning Team Chair to convene a monthly ideation workshop with teachers, parents, and students, documenting at least two service‑improvement proposals per session (indicator 3.4).\\r\\n- Assistant Principal to assign a pilot coordinator for each approved idea, outlining implementation steps and reporting progress bi‑weekly.\\r\\n- Principal to feature successful innovations in the quarterly school newsletter, encouraging replication across grade levels.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:16:03\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:16:03\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:16:03\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 12:16:03'),
(159, 204, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":204,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":13,\"dimension_id\":28,\"indicator_id\":191,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"Leverage the improved score by deepening parent partnership and open reporting.\\r\\n- Governance Committee Chair to formalize a PTA liaison role, meeting with the PTA chair monthly and recording minutes (indicator 4.3).\\r\\n- Strategic Planning Officer to publish a semi‑annual stakeholder pulse survey on the school website within two weeks of collection.\\r\\n- School Secretary to maintain a searchable digital archive of all SGC and PTA meeting minutes, uploaded within one business day of each meeting.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:02\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:02\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:02\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 12:17:02'),
(160, 205, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":205,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":13,\"dimension_id\":30,\"indicator_id\":203,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"Target the sharp decline by tightening expense tracking and planning infrastructure improvements.\\r\\n- Finance Officer to monitor monthly MOOE utilization and generate a utilization report by the 5th of each month (indicator 6.6).\\r\\n- Facilities Manager to develop a three‑year infrastructure improvement plan, prioritizing critical repairs, and submit quarterly progress updates by the 10th.\\r\\n- Procurement Officer to conduct a semi‑annual vendor performance review and publish findings and recommendations within two weeks of review (indicator 6.2).\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:45\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:45\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11 20:17:45\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-11 12:17:45'),
