(348, 252, 4, 'coordinator_validated', 'approved', 'finalized', 46, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":252,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":24,\"dimension_id\":30,\"indicator_id\":205,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"Build on the strong financial performance by deepening budget visibility and stakeholder involvement.\\r\\n- Finance Officer to maintain a monthly cash‑flow dashboard accessible to the school council, updating it by the 5th of each month (indicator 6.4).\\r\\n- Procurement Officer to publish a transparent bidding log on the school portal within three days after each procurement cycle, reviewed quarterly.\\r\\n- School Head to convene a bi‑annual resource‑allocation review meeting with department heads, finalizing adjustments by 15 November per DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024.\\r\\n- School Head to introduce an annual financial literacy workshop for teachers and staff, scheduled each June, to foster understanding of budgeting processes.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"finalized\",\"current_owner_role\":null,\"current_owner_user_id\":null,\"last_action_by\":46,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:53:30\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":37,\"submitted_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:52:58\",\"approved_by\":46,\"approved_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:53:19\",\"validated_by\":46,\"validated_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:53:30\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:52:53\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-18 03:53:30\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-17 19:53:30'),
(349, 253, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":253,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":25,\"dimension_id\":25,\"indicator_id\":174,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"With the recent rise to 90.3%, it\'s important to keep momentum while guarding against potential decline.\\r\\n- Curriculum Coordinator to lead quarterly data‑analysis meetings on student performance, documenting adjustments by the 15th of the month (indicator 1.8).\\r\\n- Grade Level Leaders to design and implement at least one interdisciplinary community‑based project per term, submitting brief reports within two weeks after term end.\\r\\n- School Head to approve an annual curriculum audit aligned with DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024, to be completed by 30 June and shared with teachers.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:04\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:04\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:04\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-17 20:04:04'),
(350, 254, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":254,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":25,\"dimension_id\":26,\"indicator_id\":179,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"Score rose modestly, but the high decline risk suggests reinforcing support structures.\\r\\n- Learning Experience Coordinator to schedule monthly outreach classes for out‑of‑school learners, targeting 20 participants per session and logging attendance (indicator 2.5).\\r\\n- Teachers to upload blended‑learning modules to the school portal weekly and record student progress in the LMS.\\r\\n- School Head to allocate a quarterly budget for learning materials and transport subsidies, approving allocations by 15 October per DepEd Order No. 007, s. 2024.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:13\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:13\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:13\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-17 20:04:13'),
(351, 255, 1, 'created', NULL, 'draft', 37, NULL, '{\"plan_id\":255,\"school_id\":1,\"cycle_id\":25,\"dimension_id\":28,\"indicator_id\":194,\"priority_level\":\"Low\",\"objective\":\"The drop to 83.3% signals a need for tighter governance mechanisms.\\r\\n- Governance Committee Chair to conduct semi‑annual stakeholder satisfaction surveys (indicator 4.6) and publish a summary report on the school portal within 15 days of each survey.\\r\\n- PTA President to host a quarterly partnership showcase, inviting NGOs and neighboring schools, and develop a written memorandum of understanding for each partnership within two weeks.\\r\\n- School Head to form a Stakeholder Advisory Council that meets bi‑annually, with minutes circulated within five days and actionable recommendations submitted to the school board by 30 April and 30 October.\",\"strategy\":\"Implement and monitor this recommendation with the responsible SBM team, then review the dimension score in the next assessment cycle.\",\"person_responsible\":null,\"target_date\":null,\"resources_needed\":null,\"expected_output\":null,\"status\":\"planned\",\"workflow_status\":\"draft\",\"current_owner_role\":\"school_head\",\"current_owner_user_id\":37,\"last_action_by\":37,\"last_action_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:31\",\"remarks\":null,\"created_by\":37,\"submitted_by\":null,\"submitted_at\":null,\"approved_by\":null,\"approved_at\":null,\"validated_by\":null,\"validated_at\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:31\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-18 04:04:31\",\"suggestion_item_id\":null,\"suggestion_baseline_text\":null,\"is_sample\":0}', '2026-10-17 20:04:31'),
